'''Orthos''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.5 Update|Version 7.5]] increases his health, attack, range, and decreases his attack rate. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]].

